Please see the implementation and rollback/backout steps below.

Implementation Steps:
We will run a one-time Python script to populate the missing fields in GCP Firestore. Prior to running the script, we will take a backup/export of the Firestore data. Once the backup is successfully completed, we will execute the Python script to load the required fields and validate the data after the load.

Rollback/Backout Steps:
If any issues are identified during or after the implementation, we will use the Firestore backup taken prior to the change to restore the data to its pre-implementation state.